{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48984","headline":"看牡丹二首 二 · 孙鲂","name":"看牡丹二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"看花长到牡丹月，万事全忘自不知。\n风促乍开方可惜，雨淋将谢可堪悲。\n闲年对坐浑成偶，醉後抛眠恐负伊。\n也拟便休还改过，迢迢争奈一年期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙鲂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48984.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48984","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}